  'at equilibrium': 'at equilibrium',
  'At full white, {ledCount} LEDs need {peakCurrent}. This is why a 5 metre 60/m strip is a genuinely serious load, around 18 A, and why almost nobody actually runs one at full white. Brightness scales the current linearly, so a strip limited to 25% is a far more practical proposition.': 'At full white, {ledCount} LEDs need {peakCurrent}. This is why a 5 metre 60/m strip is a genuinely serious load, around 18 A, and why almost nobody actually runs one at full white. Brightness scales the current linearly, so a strip limited to 25% is a far more practical proposition.',
