  'Stray capacitance alone already exceeds the specified load, so no external capacitors can bring it down: the crystal will always run slow. Shorten the tracks, remove ground pour from under them, or choose a crystal specified for a higher CL.': 'Stray capacitance alone already exceeds the specified load, so no external capacitors can bring it down: the crystal will always run slow. Shorten the tracks, remove ground pour from under them, or choose a crystal specified for a higher CL.',
